Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.32,0:19:51.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Sky Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:56.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,棱镜白！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:56.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Prism White！
